{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/compare/496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5...24ba595a913819bbedd5528dea3df1c6a7f208da", "html_url": "https://github.com/skorokithakis/shortuuid/compare/496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5...24ba595a913819bbedd5528dea3df1c6a7f208da", "permalink_url": "https://github.com/skorokithakis/shortuuid/compare/skorokithakis:496cddf...skorokithakis:24ba595", "diff_url": "https://github.com/skorokithakis/shortuuid/compare/496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5...24ba595a913819bbedd5528dea3df1c6a7f208da.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/skorokithakis/shortuuid/compare/496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5...24ba595a913819bbedd5528dea3df1c6a7f208da.patch", "base_commit": {"sha": "496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5", "node_id": "C_kwDOABLPttoAKDQ5NmNkZGYxODZiNjU5OGViZWJlN2JlNWM5OWMwNzE1ZTdmYzVhYjU", "commit": {"author": {"name": "patchwright", "email": "validatedbox123@duck.com", "date": "2026-06-18T21:07:12Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-06-18T21:07:12Z"}, "message": "fix: Fix string_to_int radix when alphabet_index is provided (#115)\n\n* Fix string_to_int radix when alphabet_index is provided\n\nstring_to_int's docstring states that when an alphabet_index is passed,\nthe alphabet argument is ignored. The implementation still used\nlen(alphabet) as the numeric base, so passing an alphabet_index built\nfrom a longer alphabet than the alphabet argument decoded the string in\nthe wrong radix. Derive the radix from the supplied index instead;\nfor any index built the documented way this is identical to len(alphabet).\n\n* Use len(alphabet_index) for radix per review suggestion\n\nSimpler and O(1); identical to max(values)+1 for any well-formed\nindex (keys=chars, values=0..N-1).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: patchwright <292882882+patchwright@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: patchwright <patchwright@users.noreply.github.com>", "tree": {"sha": "5b55744d0886943b9e57f6c9df916c0a1ab4edf4", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/git/trees/5b55744d0886943b9e57f6c9df916c0a1ab4edf4"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/git/commits/496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNF4ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATOIQAK/Q/U+EcqSeaARqL4Ktl9u4\nOtc0QpXOlr3US9lCVQHNqXFJ5O/7aaa27My4Zn3R1cGafkC2NqQ37BY6oPDBldoG\nSK8i7Xrkq61gdISQTwMdkDCyMkssUITM3PLovCMZe4GU6NnDWiZ51rYYVaBMbdaT\nny4oJARPGDFacrFtzdhQwEEKF4zQySu2o++aS1D+/3vAtQIU1azoxJ3qGestKAZf\nNi5zyg7AfCWi0T70Jyw/bIO3dCCngc0AmTNy4VdQR4YoPvDlXMGngovTsZ0xWSx4\n8OU1PCiLYSu7DS/2se+90axJI53ykNG9kg5SvD8BM/yhxNPSs70NA736ASLyFx0z\nZAzCVh+gfB2PkjbKDIVOtVjmDOTLrfqliqy/+S6clQntcZMufi2MQ87V5YUQD/bp\nJn2gykY2lzgWPQgGN70vA5TMxTCW5BItkGiSLHapyYkjEmrayc1PwcxLm/Deq+h7\noLNsMat7HU3fdLTy70kIWoXoJC9OetXgObZ6OZyWOElzIZ3VU25LavoziyseEjCQ\nf/MNn9I64nevlJOHpmbhoIj25rozz537gEB8AxVOueQFs7dlGs3RwwDCRoRsHOUv\nENYwJ6UGQ7BrErydrEKcpjaE8enk9hycMtYwgcB/JK+M4V14pFfQD7iRaTCZDe99\n6p89Z2WQt3uGltYMjwRX\n=ogZH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 5b55744d0886943b9e57f6c9df916c0a1ab4edf4\nparent b8898871c5b977549b4ecbecbb638d8e06d7359e\nauthor patchwright <validatedbox123@duck.com> 1781816832 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781816832 +0300\n\nfix: Fix string_to_int radix when alphabet_index is provided (#115)\n\n* Fix string_to_int radix when alphabet_index is provided\n\nstring_to_int's docstring states that when an alphabet_index is passed,\nthe alphabet argument is ignored. The implementation still used\nlen(alphabet) as the numeric base, so passing an alphabet_index built\nfrom a longer alphabet than the alphabet argument decoded the string in\nthe wrong radix. Derive the radix from the supplied index instead;\nfor any index built the documented way this is identical to len(alphabet).\n\n* Use len(alphabet_index) for radix per review suggestion\n\nSimpler and O(1); identical to max(values)+1 for any well-formed\nindex (keys=chars, values=0..N-1).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: patchwright <292882882+patchwright@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: patchwright <patchwright@users.noreply.github.com>", "verified_at": "2026-06-18T21:07:13Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/commits/496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5", "html_url": "https://github.com/skorokithakis/shortuuid/commit/496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/commits/496cddf186b6598ebebe7be5c99c0715e7fc5ab5/comments", "author": {"login": "patchwright", "id": 292882882, "node_id": "U_kgDOEXUJwg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292882882?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright", "html_url": "https://github.com/patchwright", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/patchwright/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https:/